      "message": "Opened b/580948219 to track runtime reporting/telemetry for recovered watchdog warnings.\n\nToday, the OS only reads `EC_CMD_GET_PANIC_INFO` at AP boot, so recovered warnings are only reported if the AP happens to warm-reboot later while EC RAM stays powered. That attaches unrelated logs from the later reboot, loses warnings across EC power-off/hibernate, and causes any subsequent hard watchdog reset to be misreported with the old warning\u0027s PC and task.",
